    "title": "Make A Pose",
    "description": "In this APP , you can try to pose the character !\r\nYou can create some simple object.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Edit every joint to make a pose in a natural and intuitive way , You can rotate the blue part of the ball which is below the screen to edit the joint ,it is easy to use\r\n- You can non-uniform scale each part of the character\r\n- You can set the color of object or character \r\n- Save 9 pose at the same time\r\n- Pose with the object\r\n- Change the direction of the light to change the shadow\uff08 not real shadow \uff0creference only \uff09\r\n\r\nIf you got problem or find a bug ,please email me.\r\nMy Email address : waci11@163.com",
